                # zero region: expand rect around seed bbox requiring cells 0 or c; take maximal by area with anchor preference
                # candidate rects: top r0 in 0..R0, bottom up to where purity holds; prefer rect whose TL is on tile grid aligning seed: seed offset must equal k*(hh), m*(ww). Try both: exact seed-anchored & max-area anchored.
